Azecotron Web attribution

Azecotron Web is a downstream Chromium-derived project for Synth Browser.

The Chromium source checkout used to build Azecotron is fetched from the
official Chromium source repository at build time and retains Chromium's
LICENSE plus every upstream third-party license/notice distributed with that
checkout.

Synth Browser's own code and fork patches are maintained in this repository.
We do not ship Google Chrome proprietary branding or Google-internal assets.
